  python  TiffImagePlugin, WebPImagePlugin, IcoImagePlugin, AvifImagePlugin, TgaImagePlugin, PsdImagePlugin, PcxImagePlugin, DdsImagePlugin, QoiImagePlugin, Jpeg2KImagePlugin, EpsImagePlugin, PdfImagePlugin, and the other plugins
  note    each would be a subpackage beside `image/png`; PDF writing is `pdf`'s

capability image/sequence  the frames of an animation
