capability image/screen  the screen grabbed, an image shown in a window or a viewer
  heroes  refused: a library of images in memory opens no window and reads no screen
  go      -
  rust    -
  python  ImageGrab.grab, ImageGrab.grabclipboard, ImageShow.show, Image.show, ImageTk, ImageQt, ImageWin
  note    -

dropped
  go      Image, PalettedImage, RGBA64Image, draw.Image, draw.RGBA64Image, draw.Drawer, draw.Quantizer, color.Color, color.Model: interfaces, which the language has none of; the one image type stands for every implementation
  go      Rectangle and Point as images and as arithmetic (the methods listed under image/crop): an image here begins at 0, 0 and a function takes x, y, width and height
  go      the Opaque, Bounds, ColorModel and PixOffset methods of every image type: fields and formulas of `Image` here
  python  Image.close, Image.__enter__, Image.__exit__, Image.copy, Image.load, Image.readonly, Image.fp, Image.filename: a file's lifetime and Pillow's lazy loading; an image here is a value, copied as every value is
  python  Image.Image.toqimage, Image.Image.toqpixmap, Image.Image.tobitmap, Image.fromqimage, Image.fromqpixmap: Qt's and X's types
